# Tend deploys as a pure static site (no build step, no serverless functions).
#
# The Python serverless API (AI parse/gifts + calendar feed) lives on the
# `serverless-api` branch, NOT on main. It was removed from main because
# Vercel's Python builder auto-detects any .py in the source tree and fails
# the build looking for a single entrypoint — even when .vercelignore lists it.
# Re-enable by merging serverless-api with a single consolidated entrypoint.
#
# The app needs none of it to run: login/cloud-sync are client-side (Supabase),
# and the AI endpoints fall back to an offline parser when unavailable.

# Local dev / archive cruft
_archive_nextjs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
